OL,3,GNEWSAClimber Laura completes 'full
OL,4,Ahouse' of 1,072 peaks around UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a big day for Scottish climber
OL,7,FLaura Baillie who has completed the
OL,8,F"full house" of the UK's highest peaks.
OL,10,FReaching the top of Carn na h-Easgainn
OL,11,Fin the Highlands, the 38-year-old
OL,12,Fbecomes one of an elite group of about
OL,13,F100 people who have stood on all 1,072
OL,14,Fsummits.
OL,16,FTo complete the Scottish Mountaineering
OL,17,FClub challenge, hikers must tick off
OL,18,Fevery Munro, Munro Top, Corbett, Graham
OL,19,Fand Donald in Scotland - as well as
OL,20,Fevery Furth in England, Wales and
OL,21,FIreland too.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
