OL,3,GNEWSAClimber Laura completes 'full
OL,4,Ahouse' of 1,072 peaks around UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt 2,025ft (617m), Laura said she chose
OL,7,FCarn na h-Easgainn as a simple final
OL,8,Fascent so family and friends could be
OL,9,Fthere to celebrate her achievement.
